# Task Manager

A full-stack Task Management Application developed as part of my Full Stack Development internship at Thiranex.

## Features

- User registration
- User login
- Create tasks
- View saved tasks
- Edit tasks
- Mark tasks as completed
- Delete tasks
- Task statistics
- MongoDB database integration
- Responsive design

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- Mongoose

